OL,3,GNEWSALASK holds silence for Celtic fan
OL,4,Awho died during Champions League match
OL,5,
OL,6,FAustrian champions LASK have held a
OL,7,Fsilence in memory of a Celtic supporter
OL,8,Fwho died when the sides met in Glasgow
OL,9,Flast week.
OL,11,FThe 65-year-old fan became ill in the
OL,12,Fstadium during the first leg of the
OL,13,FChampions League play-off at Celtic
OL,14,FPark on Wednesday.
OL,16,FHe was taken to Glasgow Royal Infirmary
OL,17,Fbut died a short time later.
OL,19,FAhead of the return leg in Linz - which
OL,20,Fkicked off at 20:00 - LASK confirmed
OL,21,Fthey wished to pay tribute to the
OL,22,Fsupporter.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
